1
00:05:16,666 --> 00:05:22,666
After Ever Happy is a romance, drama film directed by Castille Landon.

2
00:10:33,333 --> 00:10:39,333
As a shocking truth about a couple's families emerges, the two lovers
discover they are not so different from each other.

3
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Tessa is no longer the sweet, simple, good girl she was when she met Hardin —
any more than he is the cruel, moody boy she fell so hard for.

4
00:21:06,666 --> 00:21:12,666
Tessa Young, played by Josephine Langford.

5
00:26:23,333 --> 00:26:29,333
Hardin Scott, played by Hero Fiennes Tiffin.

6
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:46,000
Robert, played by Carter Jenkins.

7
00:36:56,666 --> 00:37:02,666
Trish Daniels, played by Louise Lombard.

8
00:42:13,333 --> 00:42:19,333
Landon Gibson, played by Chance Perdomo.

9
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:36,000
Ken Scott, played by Rob Estes.

10
00:52:46,666 --> 00:52:52,666
After Ever Happy (released in some countries as After Ever After and After Forever) is a 2022 American romantic drama film
directed by Castille Landon from a screenplay by Sharon Soboil, based on the 2015 novel of the same name by Anna Todd.

11
00:58:03,333 --> 00:58:09,333
It is the sequel to After We Fell (2021) and the fourth
installment in the After film series.

12
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
The film stars Josephine Langford and Hero Fiennes Tiffin reprising
their roles as Tessa Young and Hardin Scott, respectively.

13
01:08:36,666 --> 01:08:42,666
The film was shot back-to-back in Bulgaria in 2020
with its predecessor, After We Fell.

14
01:13:53,333 --> 01:13:59,333
After Ever Happy was released in Italy on August 22, 2022, in Europe from August 24, 2022,
and was released in the United States on September 7, by Voltage Pictures.

15
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
Like its predecessors, it received negative reviews.

16
01:24:26,666 --> 01:24:32,666
The film explores themes of based on novel or book, love, teenage crush.

17
01:29:43,333 --> 01:29:49,333
The tone is emotional.
